  "id": "therapeutic-factors",
  "term": "therapeutic factors",
  "definition": "Therapeutic factors are the elements or processes within therapy that help produce positive change in a person’s psychological or physical outcomes. In the creative arts therapies, the term refers to both general helpful features shared with other psychotherapies and some factors that are more specific to arts-based work, such as embodiment, concretization, and the use of symbolism and metaphor.",
